# Nexus project

- UI must follow `DESIGN.md` (Discord-inspired indigo/Blurple system).
- Prefer project skills under `.agents/skills/`: `nextjs`, `tailwind-4-docs`, `web-design-guidelines`, `framer-motion-animator`, `gsap-framer-scroll-animation`, `tanstack-query-best-practices`.
- Next.js app is `apps/web` (App Router, Turbopack). Edge network boundary file is `proxy.ts` (not `middleware.ts`).
- Do not invent alternate brand colors or generic purple/cream AI aesthetics that conflict with DESIGN.md.
